      <title>Role reversals: Alabama returns to the Rose Bowl as a CFP underdog to face powerhouse Indiana</title>
      <link>https://www.ipm.org/news/2025-12-30/role-reversals-alabama-returns-to-the-rose-bowl-as-a-cfp-underdog-to-face-powerhouse-indiana</link>
      <description>The Crimson Tide (No. 11 AP, No. 9 CFP) are returning to the Rose Bowl’s storied turf on Thursday, but they’re underdogs against unbeaten Indiana (No. 1 AP, No. 1 CFP), which has improbably constructed a burgeoning superpower from the ground up during those two short years.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ipm.org/news/2025-12-30/role-reversals-alabama-returns-to-the-rose-bowl-as-a-cfp-underdog-to-face-powerhouse-indiana</guid>
