      <title>What’s happening for New Year’s, Rose Bowl in Bloomington?</title>
      <link>https://www.ipm.org/news/2025-12-31/whats-happening-for-new-years-rose-bowl-in-bloomington</link>
      <description>Honky tonk music, free drinks and hissing cockroaches — what better way to ring in the new year in Bloomington? Locals celebrating the end of 2025 can find kid-friendly and 21-plus options around town on Wednesday. New Year’s Day will bring fun for Hoosier fans.</description>
